DESIGN ATTRIBUTION
==================

No third-party code is vendored in this project. The offline scope removed
every reason to. What follows credits design inspiration only, with the licence
status of each source stated plainly.

Glicio/claude-waybar-status
  Per-session state model and the sticky-slot idea.
  NO LICENCE FILE — all rights reserved.
  No code has been copied, read, or adapted. The design here is clean-room,
  described from that project's public README, which is all that was consulted.

org.kde.plasma.claudelimits — Felix
  MIT licensed.
  Referenced for Plasma 6 plasmoid structure and the executable data-engine
  pattern. No code copied. Retain this notice if any code is later used.

com.cbo.claudeusage — Craig Borrows
  MIT licensed.
  Referenced for Kirigami theme-role usage. No code copied. Retain this notice
  if any code is later used.

fuziontech/claude-quota-widget
  MIT licensed.
  Referenced for the justfile plasmoid development loop. No code copied.

stewartlord/identicon.js
  BSD-2-Clause licensed. Copyright (c) 2018, Stewart Lord.
  The normative reference for the project identicon. Executed, unmodified and
  unvendored, to generate identicon/vectors.json, which tests/test_conformance.py
  asserts against. Its grid and colour rules were transliterated into Python; no
  code was copied. Fetched on demand per identicon/reference/README.md and
  git-ignored. If this library is ever vendored, its copyright notice,
  conditions list and disclaimer must be reproduced here in full.

dgraham/identicon
  MIT licensed.
  Evaluated, not used. Its grid rule was transcribed from src/lib.rs and
  src/nibbler.rs and confirmed to agree with the reference on all ten vectors,
  which is the evidence that the grid is a property of the convention rather
  than of one author. Its colour rule differs and was not taken. No code copied,
  nothing vendored, and it is not required to build or test this project.

